      "content": "thanks for the info on the crystal forms. i'll try looking into those inhibitors. one other thing though—is it possible for the bloom to happen because of something environmental i'm not seeing? like some kind of sudden moisture spike or something that just \"invades\" the setting area? i'm just trying to rule out anything that might be messing with the stability while it's sitting.",
